---
layout: base.njk
title: "AI Tools Directory: Hand-Checked Picks"
description: "A hand-checked directory of AI tools, sorted by what you want to do: writing, resumes, images, video, websites, meetings and more."
permalink: /directory/
crumbs: [{name: "Home", url: "/"}, {name: "AI Directory", url: "/directory/"}]
---
{% set total = directory.categories | totalLinks %}
<div class="content">
  <h1>The <em>AI</em> Directory</h1>
  <p>{{ total }} AI tools in {{ directory.categories | length }} categories. Every one is checked by a person. Type what you want to do:</p>
  <form action="/directory/" method="get" role="search" class="center">
    <label for="dq" class="sr">Filter tools</label>
    <input id="dq" name="q" type="search" data-filter placeholder="e.g. resume, video, logo" style="width:80%;padding:6px;border:2px inset #C0C0C0;font:16px Verdana,sans-serif">
  </form>
  <p class="small center" data-count aria-live="polite"></p>

  {% for cat in directory.categories %}
  <section data-cat>
    <h2 id="{{ cat.slug }}" style="background:{{ cat.color }}"><a href="/directory/{{ cat.slug }}/" style="color:#000">{{ cat.name }}</a> <span class="small">({{ cat.links | length }})</span></h2>
    {% for l in cat.links | sort(true, false, "featured") %}{% include "listing.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
  <p class="note">Made an AI tool? <a href="/submit/">Get it listed here &raquo;</a></p>
</div>
